{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列是茂盛的葡萄树，硕果累累。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，他结果越多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"建造的祭坛就越多；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"土地出产越丰富，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他就把神柱装饰得越美丽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们心怀诡诈，必受惩罚。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华要拆毁他们的祭坛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎他们的神柱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时他们会说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我们没有君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我们不敬畏耶和华。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王能为我们做什么呢？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说虚话，起假誓，立空盟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此不法之事滋长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹如田间犁沟中蔓延的毒草。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒玛利亚的居民要因伯·亚文的牛犊偶像而惊恐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭拜它的人要哀伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"供奉它的祭司要痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为它的荣耀将离开他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它要被带到亚述去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作为贡物献给强大的亚述王。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲因此而受人嘲笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列因自己的偶像而蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒玛利亚和它的君王要被毁灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像漂浮在水面上的枯枝一样消逝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列犯罪之地——亚文","poem":1},{"noteId":17},{"text":"的丘坛要被拆毁。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的祭坛上要长满荆棘和蒺藜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要向高山说：“遮盖我们吧！”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对小丘说：“倒在我们身上吧！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“以色列人啊，从基比亚的日子以来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们一直不断地犯罪，从未改变。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道战祸没有临到基比亚的邪恶之辈吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要按自己的心意惩罚你们。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国要联合攻击你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惩罚你们的双重罪恶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲本是驯服的母牛犊，喜欢打谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在我要把轭套在它肥美的颈项上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要驾驭以法莲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大必耕田，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各","poem":1},{"noteId":18},{"text":"必耙地。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"你们要为自己种植公义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就能收获慈爱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在是寻求耶和华的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要犁开刚硬的心田，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等祂来使公义如雨浇灌你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，你们种的是邪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收的是不义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃的是谎言的果实。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们倚靠自己的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仰仗众多的勇士。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，战争的喧嚣将从你们中间传出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的一切堡垒将被摧毁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恰如沙勒幔在战争之日摧毁伯·亚比勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将城中的母子一同摔死。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伯特利","poem":1},{"noteId":19},{"text":"啊，你罪大恶极，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必遭遇同样的下场。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日来临时，以色列的王将被彻底消灭。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":17,"caller":"+","text":"“亚文”指伯·亚文，伯·亚文的意思见本卷书4:15节注脚。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":8}},{"noteId":18,"caller":"+","text":"“雅各”在旧约中常与“以色列”互换使用，有时指以色列人的先祖雅各，有时指以色列民族。本节的以法莲和雅各都代指北国以色列。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":11}},{"noteId":19,"caller":"+","text":"“伯特利”此处代指以色列人。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}